---
title: Lemon Torte
author: Mary Arntson
category: Desserts
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@lemon supreme cake{1}
@sweetened condensed milk{1%can}
@grated rind of lemons{2}
@yellow food coloring
@whipped cream or cool whip{1%cup}
@whipped cream

Bake 1 lemon supreme cake. When cool, slice each layer in half so that you have 4 layers.
Filling - mix 1 can of sweetened condensed milk and the grated rinds of two lemons and yellow food coloring. When thickened, add 1 cup whipped cream or cool whip. Fill layers and frost with whipped cream.
